{{!-- The Haltung picker.

Nine Haltungen in one popover instead of the select this replaces. Three things
made the select the wrong control: the choice is made under time pressure at the
table, a collapsed list shows one option at a time, and a native select emits no
change when its current option is picked again — which the rules make a real act,
because taking a Haltung clears both repeated-defence counters. Every option here
is a button, so re-taking the current one needs no separate control.

The bands come from `CONFIG.TNO.stanceGroups`; the detail panel reads out the
hovered option, falling back to the one in force, and closes on the defence the
Haltung permits — which is the only question the defence side of an exchange
ever asks it. --}}
<div class='stance-popover-body'>

  <div class='stance-popover-groups'>
    {{#each groups as |group|}}
      <section class='stance-popover-group'>
        <h5>{{group.label}}</h5>
        <div class='stance-popover-grid'>
          {{#each group.stances as |stance|}}
            <button type='button' class='stance-option{{#if stance.selected}} selected{{/if}}'
                    data-stance='{{stance.key}}'
                    data-stance-icon='{{stance.icon}}'
                    data-stance-name='{{stance.label}}'
                    data-stance-effect='{{stance.effect}}'
                    data-stance-defenses='{{stance.defenses}}'
                    aria-pressed='{{#if stance.selected}}true{{else}}false{{/if}}'>
              <i class='fa-solid {{stance.icon}}' aria-hidden='true'></i>
              <span>{{stance.label}}</span>
            </button>
          {{/each}}
        </div>
      </section>
    {{/each}}
  </div>

  <aside class='stance-popover-detail' aria-live='polite'>
    <span class='stance-detail-icon'>
      <i class='fa-solid {{detail.icon}}' aria-hidden='true'></i>
    </span>
    <strong class='stance-detail-name'>{{detail.label}}</strong>
    <span class='stance-detail-effect'>{{detail.effect}}</span>
    <span class='stance-detail-defenses'>
      <small>{{localize 'TNO.Combat.StanceDefenses'}}</small>
      <span>{{detail.defenses}}</span>
    </span>
  </aside>

</div>
